.TH THUMTOO-TILE 1 "2026-09-16" "thumtoo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
thumtoo-tile \- request or inspect a single tile cell
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B thumtoo-tile
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
CLI helper around
.B Client::request_tile
for one scale/x/y cell. Useful for debugging Galapix-compatible 256\(mu256
JPEG cells and live PDF region tiles.
.PP
See
.B \-\-help
for the full option list (URI, scale, cell coordinates, cache directory,
cache-only mode).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR thumtoo (7),
.BR thumtoo-prepare (1),
.BR thumtoo-status (1)
